0,Huarijio language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Huarijio_language,"Huarijio (Huarijío in Spanish; also spelled Guarijío, Varihío, and Warihío) is a Uto-Aztecan language of the states of Chihuahua and Sonora in northwestern Mexico.",Huarijío,Uto-Aztecan
1,Guarijio people - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guarijio_people,"The Guarijío language is a Tarahumaran language of the Uto-Aztecan language family, written in the Latin script. A dictionary and grammar have been published for the language. [2]",Huarijío,Uto-Aztecan
