5,Huarijío,https://cohenpr-xpf.github.io/XPF/conv_resources/info/var.html,"Vowel disharmony plays a role in Huarijío when concerning the addition of suffixes (Armendáriz 2005, 26): If the vowel of the root is low, the vowel of the suffix will be high and vice versa. Reduplication of prefixes is abundant in Huarijío (Haugen 2014, 5).",Huarijío,Uto-Aztecan
